<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 12:40:46 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Cloudflare 推出 Precursor；针对现代机器人的 OneClick 行为防御</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cloudflare-introduces-precursor-oneclick-behavioral-defense-against-modern-bots</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 12:40:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cloudflare-introduces-precursor-oneclick-behavioral-defense-against-modern-bots</guid></item><item><title>Katalyst Space 在恢复 Swift 维修航天器的控制方面取得进展</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/katalyst-space-makes-progress-in-restoring-control-of-swift-servicing-spacecraft</link><description>华盛顿——这家开发航天器以提升美国宇航局天文台轨道的公司表示，该公司在解决航天器问题方面正在取得进展。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/katalyst-space-makes-progress-in-restoring-control-of-swift-servicing-spacecraft.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 12:25:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/katalyst-space-makes-progress-in-restoring-control-of-swift-servicing-spacecraft</guid></item><item><title>三星的内部机器人是芯片游戏，而不是产品</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/samsungs-inhouse-robots-are-a-chip-play-not-a-product</link><description>三星并没有从内部提拔来领导 RX 的战略——它聘请了执行副总裁 Lee Dongkun，他曾在现代汽车集团（波士顿动力公司的母公司）负责机器人战略，并在现代推动电动 Atlas 人形机器人和 Spot 四足机器人商业化期间监督了这两种机器人的开发。这次招聘，加上三星的 Rainbow Robotics 子公司已经将 RBY1 轮式双臂平台商业化，并开发了 HUBO 双足原型，这标志着该公司正在整合部署专业知识，而不仅仅是研究能力。请参阅我们的报道&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/samsungs-inhouse-robots-are-a-chip-play-not-a-product.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 12:10:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/samsungs-inhouse-robots-are-a-chip-play-not-a-product</guid></item><item><title>限制时间的饮食可能有助于老年人保留认知功能</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/time-restricted-eating-may-help-retain-cognitive-function-in-older-adults</link><description>一项小型临床试验的结果表明，通过减少一天中的进食时间可能会降低患痴呆症的风险。这项试点研究涉及针对超重或肥胖的老年女性的减肥计划，结果显示，那些限制每日饮食时间而不是仅仅减少卡路里摄入量的人的认知能力有所改善。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/time-restricted-eating-may-help-retain-cognitive-function-in-older-adults2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:55:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/time-restricted-eating-may-help-retain-cognitive-function-in-older-adults</guid></item><item><title>陷入困境的对冲基金 Situational Awareness 向芯片初创公司 Source Foundry 投资 4 亿美元</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/embattled-hedge-fund-situational-awareness-invests-400m-in-chip-startup-source-foundry</link><description>Situational Awareness 上个月可能不得不出售其大部分公开投资组合，但这家专注于人工智能的对冲基金仍在进行一些大赌注。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/embattled-hedge-fund-situational-awareness-invests-400m-in-chip-startup-source-foundry.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:40:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/embattled-hedge-fund-situational-awareness-invests-400m-in-chip-startup-source-foundry</guid></item><item><title>科学家绘制休眠癌细胞图谱以进行靶向治疗</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-map-dormant-cancer-cells-for-targeted-treatment</link><description>癌症肿瘤内的活性和休眠细胞有助于复杂且具有挑战性的化疗治疗。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-map-dormant-cancer-cells-for-targeted-treatment.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:25:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-map-dormant-cancer-cells-for-targeted-treatment</guid></item><item><title>简单的生物学年龄评分表明老年人认知能力下降的风险较高</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/simple-biological-age-score-flags-higher-cognitive-decline-risk-in-older-adults</link><description>一项针对 4,818 名中国中老年人的研究发现，生物年龄较高的光线与认知障碍、情景记忆衰退和精神完整性下降的风险较高相关。这种基于年龄、肌酐、血糖和 CRP 的简单测量方法增加了适度的预测信息，但在临床使用前需要进一步验证。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/simple-biological-age-score-flags-higher-cognitive-decline-risk-in-older-adults.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:10:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/simple-biological-age-score-flags-higher-cognitive-decline-risk-in-older-adults</guid></item><item><title>大脑活动揭示了有意识感知之前视觉处理的两个阶段</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/brain-activity-reveals-two-stages-of-visual-processing-before-conscious-perception</link><description>看到感觉立刻；当我们睁开眼睛时，世界似乎就像一条连续不断的河流。但一些视觉错觉表明，后来发生的事件可以改变我们对先前发生的事情的看法，这表明大脑可能会在产生达到意识的体验之前短时间内收集和组合信息。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/brain-activity-reveals-two-stages-of-visual-processing-before-conscious-perception2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 10:55:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/brain-activity-reveals-two-stages-of-visual-processing-before-conscious-perception</guid></item><item><title>对于人工智能推动科学发现，高度可重复的数据是关键</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/for-ai-to-drive-science-discoveries-highly-reproducible-data-is-key</link><description>在 SLAC 主导的一项研究中，四个实验室合作确保人工智能训练数据的可重复性，以预测未来燃料生产的新催化剂。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/for-ai-to-drive-science-discoveries-highly-reproducible-data-is-key2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 10:40:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/for-ai-to-drive-science-discoveries-highly-reproducible-data-is-key</guid></item><item><title>时间中的光子晶体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-photonic-crystal-in-time</link><description>https://www.youtube.com &lt;a href="https://youtube.com"&gt;https://youtube.com&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://m.youtube.com"&gt;https://m.youtube.com&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://youtu.be"&gt;https://youtu.be&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com"&gt;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com&amp;quot;&lt;/a&gt; width=&amp;quot;100%&amp;quot; src=&amp;quot;https://disqus.com/recommendations/?base=default&amp;amp;f=opticsphotonicsnews&amp;amp;t_u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.optica-opn.org%2Fhome%2Fnewsroom%2F2026%2Faugust%2Fa_photonic_crystal_in_time%2F%3F_gl%3D1*6fkaq1*_up*MQ&amp;amp;t_d=Optics%20%26%20Photonics%20News%20-%20A%20Photonic%20Crystal%20in%20Time&amp;amp;t_t=Optics%20%26%20Photonics%20News%20-%20A%20Photonic%20Crystal%20in%20Time#version=766d73907bba8512b2bbb7011aecddb5&amp;quot; horizontalscrolling=&amp;quot;no&amp;quot; verticalscrolling=&amp;quot;no&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 10:25:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-photonic-crystal-in-time</guid></item></channel></rss>